  m_text: "the cat sat on the mat     and the mat was cold\n     a quick brown fox     jumps over     the lazy dog\nthe ice was thin            so the dog stayed home\n        once upon a time     there was a small letter\nit wanted to be bigger      but only for a moment\n     the end              the end         the end"
